From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Solomon <47696354+OliverSolomon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:46:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Host controls: comments, Share, the File menu and
 switches for each surface

New Comment without text asks the host to compose (no empty comment, the
pane never opens, balloon clicks go to the host), Share can go to the host,
the File menu and each export format can be arranged item by item, and the
host can hide the context menu, rulers, Navigation pane, zoom and the
page-view buttons.
---
